{title: TANILANILA ILAY MASOANDRO}
{artist: ERICK MANANA}
{youtube: SMlXk5yX0fo}

Tanilanila ilay masoandro mody
andrefana iny
Nivoaravoara mena,
dorehitra,nirehitra,nilentika.

Miandrandra lanitra ny velona,
mahatsiaro resy
Very fanahy mijoro
ka velon-tsetra
mievina no koditra.

{repeat: 2}
Tambazako izay tsy ory
Raha mitopy iny ambony

